t-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;\">In this episode, we talk to podcaster, author, pop culture critic, and royal watcher, Kristen Meinzer (<a href=\"https://www.kristenmeinzer.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.kristenmeinzer.com</a>)<br /><br />Highlights of our conversation include:<br />–Navigating tangled career paths<br />–Approaching interviews attentively and empathetically (helping people tell their stories)<br />–Her time at WNYC's \"The Takeaway\" and the \"Movie Date\" podcast with Rafer Guzman<br />–Distinctions between radio and podcasting<br />–Interactivity and building audiences<br />–Her \"By the Book Podcast,\" which she co-hosts with comedian Jolenta Greenberg<br />–The popularity of self-help literature<br />–Her (2019) book \"So You Want to Start a Podcast?\"<br /><br />And a whole lot more!</span><div><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial;\"></span><div style=\"color:rgb(44,44,44);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;\">CREDITS</span></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(44,44,44);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hosted by Andrew J. Salvati</span></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(44,44,44);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Music by Poddington Bear</span></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(44,44,44);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Cover Artwork by Frank Bridges</span></font></d